      240.31,
      451.23,
      268.58
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2 : This clause amends section 2 of the Betting and Gaming Levy Act, No. 40of 1988 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and the legal effect of thesection as amended is to-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      155.71,
      278.71,
      451.17,
      297.38
    ],
    "text": "(a)increase the levy on the gross collection of the business of Bookmaker orbusiness of Gaming to fifteen per centum;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      155.71,
      307.51,
      451.19,
      326.18
    ],
    "text": "(b)provide for the collection of a casino entrance levy from any citizen of SriLanka who enters a place of business of gaming;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      156.43,
      336.31,
      451.18,
      354.98
    ],
    "text": "(c)provide for the manner and the procedure for the payment and the collection ofthe casino entrance levy.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.15,
      365.11,
      451.19,
      383.78
    ],
    "text": "Clause 3 : This clause amends section 4 of the principal enactment and the legal effectof the section as amended is to \u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      155.71,
      393.91,
      451.21,
      412.58
    ],
    "text": "(a)extend the application of subsections (2), (3) and (4) of that section to the levyon the gross collection and to the casino entrance levy;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      155.71,
      422.71,
      451.16,
      441.38
    ],
    "text": "(b)extend the application of certain provisions of the Inland Revenue Act No. 24of 2017to the principal enactment.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.15,
      451.51,
      451.21,
      489.38
    ],
    "text": "Clause 4 : This clause amends section 5 of the principal enactment and the legal effectof the section as mended is to provide for the application of certain provisions of the Turnover Tax Act No. 69 of 1981 together with the provisions of section 4(5) of the principalenactment.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.15,
      499.51,
      451.21,
      518.18
    ],
    "text": "Clause 5 : This clause amends section 7 of the principal enactment by the insertion ofa new definition for the expression \u201ccitizen of Sri Lanka\u201d.",
